	(title_block
		(title "Receiver board: top level")
		(date "2026-11-19")
		(rev "0.1")
		(company "Satellite Watch")
		(comment 1 "Receiver board, phase 1")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "RECEIVER BOARD (phase 1)\n2x2 Iridium patch array, four phase-locked receive channels, shared LO and sample clock.\nPlugs into SoC and FPGA development kits through the board-to-board connector on this sheet.\n\nDecided 2026-11-19: IF about 50 MHz (undersampled at 40 MHz, aliases to 10 MHz), MAX1193 8-bit converters, JLCPCB assembly.\nSKELETON ONLY: sheet hierarchy and inter-sheet net names. No parts placed yet.\nParts arrive from the sourcing thread; drawn blocks go to the simulation thread.\n\nTO PLACE ON THIS SHEET: board-to-board connector (5V_MAIN, GND, SPI_SYNTH_*, SYNTH_CE, SYNTH_LOCK_DETECT,\nLNA_EN, LNB_SEL, ADC_PD, 40MHz_FPGA_CLK, ADC1_D0..7, ADC2_D0..7), LNB coax connector (LNB_RF_IN), test points.\n\nPower rails are global power symbols, not sheet pins: 5V_MAIN, 3.3V_RF, 3.3V_SYNTH, 3.3V_ADC."
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "afbdadda-6541-56f3-a794-11a307352d5e")
	)
